# Environment Variables for Render Deployment

## Copy these to your Render Environment Variables section:

### Basic Configuration
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=4000
JWT_ISSUER=ds-smartcontract
JWT_AUDIENCE=ds-smartcontract-users
ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL=15m
REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL=7d
APP_ID=production-app

### Blockchain Configuration
CHAIN_ID=11155111
RPC_URL=https://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_API_KEY
PRIVATE_KEY=your_wallet_private_key_without_0x_prefix
CONTRACT_ADDRESS=your_deployed_contract_address

### Security (Let Render auto-generate these)
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=[Auto-generate in Render]
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=[Auto-generate in Render]
APP_SECRET=[Auto-generate in Render]

### CORS Configuration
CORS_ORIGIN=https://your-frontend-domain.com,https://your-app.onrender.com

## Notes:
1. Replace YOUR_ALCHEMY_API_KEY with your actual Alchemy API key
2. Use a dedicated wallet for PRIVATE_KEY, not your main wallet
3. CONTRACT_ADDRESS should be set after deploying your smart contract
4. For CORS_ORIGIN, list all domains that should access your API
5. Use Render's "Generate Value" feature for JWT secrets